                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "4) Along with these cuts, the budget would penalize organizations that work with Planned Parenthood and provide reproductive health care.\n\nThis would deny patients access to essential healthcare services like birth control, STI testing and treatment, wellness exams, and more.",
