                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Stopped by @kpthrive Antelope Valley to meet with their doctors and team. They shared the work they\u2019re doing to support patients and families across our community.\n\nIn Congress, I\u2019ll keep fighting to protect Medicare and Medicaid, because every family deserves access to quality, affordable healthcare. Thanks to the Kaiser team for the warm welcome and for all you do to keep the Antelope Valley healthy.",
