                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Yesterday, my team met with @ACSCAN  to discuss their advocacy on prevention, treatment, and improving quality of life for patients and survivors.\n\nI\u2019m committed to protecting federal science and research programs because investing in science saves lives, drives new cancer treatments, and ensures families have access to the care they need.\n\nThanks to partners like ACSCAN for all their work supporting patients in our district and across the country!",
