                "text": "Families across our district are worried about what would happen if House Republicans fail to extend Affordable Care Act credits.\n\nOne constituent shared how changes to the ACA could threaten her children\u2019s coverage and her adult son\u2019s disability care.\n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting to protect affordable, accessible health care for every family.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
