                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Many older adults in our district depend on ACA coverage before they qualify for Medicare. \n\nFor a 60-year-old couple earning $85,000, losing ACA tax credits could mean paying $1,900 more per month for coverage. \n\nSeniors deserve stability, not sudden spikes in costs.",
                "text_lang": "en",
