                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Young people in our community like recent college grads, early career professionals, and service workers are also at risk.\n\nUnder current proposals, nearly 1 in 4 young adults could lose coverage, the biggest jump in uninsurance in any age group.",
